n), monstrous arachnids with calcified porous bone armor and venom-dripping stingers.\n<Subject 4> is the frontier wasteland crevice (@Scene_Master_2x2), an arid rocky canyon landscape with steep patinated basalt walls.\n\nsummary:\nA 10-second wide-angle tense standoff where two warriors are surrounded by monstrous bone-scorpions in a rocky crevice, culminating in a sudden strike.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1>: fully_preserved in sharp focus with pore-level realism.\n<Subject 2>: fully_preserved in sharp focus with pore-level realism.\n<Subject 3>: fully_preserved with rigid exoskeleton texture.\n<Subject 4>: fully_preserved.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is in live-action photorealistic Chinese Xianxia drama cinema style, shot on ARRI Alexa 65 with Panavision Sphero 65 Cine lenses, physical cine lens with 180 deg shutter motion blur, 35mm organic Kodak Vision3 film grain, authentic high-budget Chinese television drama quality, referencing the cold battlefield cinematography of Emmanuel Lubezki. 100% matching the photorealistic live human skin texture, fabric weave, and scene material of the reference images. Zero CGI render.\n[Shot 1] 84° diagonal FOV, classic wide-angle lens, high-angle shot looking down into the rocky crevice to emphasize the feeling of being trapped. Two light sources only: cold 4500K deep slate-blue sky fill, and dying warm 2500K dark orange embers on the horizon. Strict 60:30:10 color palette: 60% cold deep blue/grey rocky shadows, 30% warm orange horizon backlight, 10% vivid crimson from <Subject 2>'s silk. On all visible faces, one side is always slightly in shadow with chiaroscuro depth; never flat-lit faces. The first visible frame already contains all required subjects in their correct positions. <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> occupy the center background, backing against the canyon wall. <Subject 3> occupies the foreground, aggressively waving their massive pincers. From 0 to 4s, <Subject 3> creeps forward in real-time, their venomous stingers raised high; the bone armor displays hyper-realistic porous calcified textures. From 4 to 8s, <Subject 2> (VO) <d>[Chinese] 退路被断了……大意了！</d> As the voiceover plays, <Subject 2> steps backward and draws her twin swords, while <Subject 1> steps forward horizontally guarding with his heavy broadblade. CRITICAL PHYSICS: The drawn steel swords and broadblade maintain absolute rigid metallic geometry throughout the motion, with zero warping or bending. Both characters' weathered fabrics experience heavy drag delay in the wind. From 8 to 10s, the center scorpion of <Subject 3> executes a lightning-fast, real-time explosive strike, thrusting its stinger directly toward the warriors. Atmospheric desaturated haze and airborne dust swirl rapidly through the crevice. Zero slow motion.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nClicking and scuttling of heavy chitinous claws on rock, a sharp metallic ring of swords being drawn, a tense female voiceover, and a sudden kinetic whoosh of a scorpion strike.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "提示词Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [630.290771484375, 462.6627502441406], "pos": [-2031.0970458984375, 6061.8876953125], "id": 217, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "positive", "links": [409, 410], "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "av_latent", "links": [411], "label": "av_latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "av_latent"}, {"name": "audio", "links": [], "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [560, 1146], "pos": [-1318.5247802734375, 4808.77294921875], "widgets_values": ["omni_reference", "max", "", "", 1344,